url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n* Reproducible in v4.6.rc.custom_build [1549d5186]\n* Likely reproducible since #107435 got merged\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc (1549d5186) - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 08 Jan 2026 12:46:08 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (RADV NAVI31) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 30.49 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn Wayland (Wayland editor), at least on KDE Plasma 6.5 in my case, closing the game window when **Embed on Next Play** and **Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play** are enabled, does close the game, but does not stop the running project (you still have to press <kbd>F8</kbd> or the **Stop** button).\n\n![Project running](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/808530b4-0acd-42d7-a9ea-bb036f095c0a)\n\nAfter closing the window (pressing the close button or<kbd>Alt</kbd><kbd>F4</kbd>):\n![After closing the window](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dae401ff-2fc8-4e7d-af0b-15167c94b434)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Create a new project and open it\n* Make sure the editor is running the Wayland version (the issue does not occur on X11)\n* Enable both **Embed on Next Play** and **Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play**\n* Run the project, then close the window\n\nNote that if the game workspace is not floating, this does not occur, since you cannot just close the window, and have to stop project with <kbd>F8</kbd> or the **Stop** button.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114975/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114975/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}